  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_automating.header": "Automating the Casting process",
  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_automating.text_1": "This is the simplest setup for Casting automation.",
  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_automating.text_2": "The funnel above Casting Depot will pull any output items.",
  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_automating.text_3": "Molds can be inserted from a belt.",
  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_automating.text_4": "Funnels on the side can also extract output items.",
  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_automating.text_5": "When redstone signal is provided, Casting Depot won't accept any new fluids.",
  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_automating.text_6": "The signal also allows mold extraction...",
  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_automating.text_7": "...and forbids insertion.",
  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_automating.text_8": "Mechanical Arms can also interact with the Casting Depot.",
  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_molds.header": "Using different mold types",
  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_molds.text_1": "Molds can be either Sturdy or Porcelain.",
  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_molds.text_2": "Porcelain Molds will be consumed on cast...",
  "blazinghot.ponder.casting_molds.text_3": "...while Sturdy Molds are reusable.",
